# Beethoven -- Symphony No. 9, 4th movement, the "Ode to Joy" theme.
# Public domain. Transposed to C major and harmonised in the usual way; the
# melody is exact.
#
# Sixteen bars of 4/4, sixteen sixteenths each, so a quarter note is four
# columns. Almost all melody and almost no rhythm, which makes it the clearest
# thing in the book for hearing what the INSTRUMENT does -- run it 8-bit
# against 16-bit and the difference is entirely timbre.

@track ode-to-joy
  name   ODE TO JOY
  bpm    112
  beats  16
  era    16bit
  tags   classical beethoven public-domain

